msgid "%1$s on behalf of %2$s"
msgstr "%1$s on behalf of %2$s"

msgid "%1$s, absent until %2$s:"
msgstr "%1$s, absent until %2$s:"

msgid "Check that each delegated decision fits the absence and the delegable decision types. The substitute gets no right: he only sees the decisions entrusted to the absent person, and only until the end of the declared absence."
msgstr "Check that each delegated decision fits the absence and the delegable decision types. The substitute gets no right: he only sees the decisions entrusted to the absent person, and only until the end of the declared absence."

msgid "Decision delegated for the declared absence period: it will be recorded as yours, on behalf of the absent person."
msgstr "Decision delegated for the declared absence period: it will be recorded as yours, on behalf of the absent person."

msgid "Decision type"
msgstr "Decision type"

msgid "Declared absence"
msgstr "Declared absence"

msgid "Delegable decisions"
msgstr "Delegable decisions"

msgid "Delegated decisions"
msgstr "Delegated decisions"

msgid "Delegation during an absence"
msgstr "Delegation during an absence"

msgid "Lets the substitute declared in GLPI (user preferences, \"Substitutes\" tab, with a start and an end date) take the decisions waiting for an absent person, during the declared period only. A period without an end date delegates nothing. Each decision is recorded as taken by the substitute on behalf of the absent person. Waivers and risk acceptances are never delegated: they depend on a right, not on a person."
msgstr "Lets the substitute declared in GLPI (user preferences, \"Substitutes\" tab, with a start and an end date) take the decisions waiting for an absent person, during the declared period only. A period without an end date delegates nothing. Each decision is recorded as taken by the substitute on behalf of the absent person. Waivers and risk acceptances are never delegated: they depend on a right, not on a person."

msgid "Lists the decisions taken by a substitute on behalf of an absent person: who decided, for whom, when, on what, and the absence period declared in GLPI at that moment."
msgstr "Lists the decisions taken by a substitute on behalf of an absent person: who decided, for whom, when, on what, and the absence period declared in GLPI at that moment."

msgid "No decision has been taken by a substitute yet."
msgstr "No decision has been taken by a substitute yet."

msgid "Not delegable"
msgstr "Not delegable"

msgid "On behalf of"
msgstr "On behalf of"

msgid "On behalf of %1$s, absent until %2$s"
msgstr "On behalf of %1$s, absent until %2$s"

msgid "Taken by"
msgstr "Taken by"

msgid "The substitute answers for the absent approver, unless he is himself an approver of the same version."
msgstr "The substitute answers for the absent approver, unless he is himself an approver of the same version."

msgid "The substitute decides the accounts entrusted to the absent reviewer (never his own account)."
msgstr "The substitute decides the accounts entrusted to the absent reviewer (never his own account)."

msgid "You are standing in for"
msgstr "You are standing in for"

msgid "Your decisions are recorded as yours, on behalf of the absent person, and stop being possible at the end of the declared absence."
msgstr "Your decisions are recorded as yours, on behalf of the absent person, and stop being possible at the end of the declared absence."

msgid "Delegated decision"
msgid_plural "Delegated decisions"
msgstr[0] "Delegated decision"
msgstr[1] "Delegated decisions"
